# ActorEndsShot ($83:81CF), and ActorEndsShotLong ($83:81CB) by JSL, when
# a shot touches the actor, which no play
# gives it ($83:81D4: kind $13 marks the hit, the shot's code goes on at
# its end). Stage a1 s1 as cov_kind2a_harmless_shot.box: Aladdin held at
# x $0260, y $01A8 throws an apple right; in the 5 frames after, while
# the apple (record $09CB) is still at his hand, unit calls of
# ActorEndsShot on his own record (D = $08DB), each put back after.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 00,02
poke 0019E5 00,02
poke 001777 00,01
poke 0019E9 00,01
poke 0008E7 60,02
poke 0008EA A8,01
wait 20
repeat 4
poke 0008E7 60,02
poke 0008EA A8,01
hold RIGHT+A 1
end
repeat 5
call 8381CF p=30 d=08DB db=80
call 8381CB long p=30 d=08DB db=80
poke 0008E7 60,02
poke 0008EA A8,01
wait 1
end
